    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sadball</strong> is an expressive 3D platformer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Hidden Worlds</h2> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/30fb11e8b0579b0082718bd755d1843c.poster.avif?t=1744307750\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/30fb11e8b0579b0082718bd755d1843c.webm?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/30fb11e8b0579b0082718bd755d1843c.mp4?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>The pins have escaped!</i><br>Follow pins into 48 hidden worlds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Mysterious Fruits</h2> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/c5448bc4750811af99340c20515b23ed.poster.avif?t=1744307750\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/c5448bc4750811af99340c20515b23ed.webm?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/c5448bc4750811af99340c20515b23ed.mp4?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>What effect will they have?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Strange Pins</h2> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/21efc12921cb479ea7a3af7bd815b036.poster.avif?t=1744307750\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/21efc12921cb479ea7a3af7bd815b036.webm?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/21efc12921cb479ea7a3af7bd815b036.mp4?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Some pins are different...</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform Expressive Stunts</h2> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/10e81054e0b33203234384970fc26598.poster.avif?t=1744307750\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/10e81054e0b33203234384970fc26598.webm?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/10e81054e0b33203234384970fc26598.mp4?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Explore with style!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go for a Strike!</h2> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/cbd7ed525d4624a92ae0bfa73b8901d5.poster.avif?t=1744307750\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/cbd7ed525d4624a92ae0bfa73b8901d5.webm?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954030/extras/cbd7ed525d4624a92ae0bfa73b8901d5.mp4?t=1744307750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Can you play a perfect game?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Info</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Polished support for keyboard and controller!<br></li><li> Learn hundreds of tricks with an in-game discovery system!<br></li><li> Explore 48 open ended levels! <br></li><li> Eat ten different fruit, each with a unique effect! <br></li><li> Deep momentum-based combat with a dual parry system!<br></li><li> Fast, expressive movement with support for speedrunning!<br></li><li> An accessible learning curve!<br></li><li> Uncover a rich, atmospheric narrative that doesn't interrupt gameplay!</li></ul>",
